{"title":"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest Problems/Problem 26","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/d/add0cdf8706e0bfd05e0d85c0f3bb080d1d340e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = 2x - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"112\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/c/8cc3ad1aea9c68fbafaf8ea140b8a2c7957b42e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(x) = x^2 + 3x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"119\" height=\"21\" />, what is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/8/a9833377bef61c06bbefbc94386fe018e0e7da1d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(f(x)) - f(g(x))$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"142\" height=\"20\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/9/3099967f45bf2cb9a492f5befb4437d755f6df41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 2x^2 - 4x - 1 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 0 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 2x^2 - 16x + 3 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ x^2 + 6x - 2 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 2x^2 + 6x - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"714\" height=\"21\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems/Problem_26&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/a/05a4cd6616dc640f3a76e4eeaf22df15e9cd6a9b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(f(x)) = g(2x - 1) = (2x - 1)^{2} + 3(2x - 1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"352\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/f/c3f327165bdce8014ce3539d20367cf90a2fe73f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=4x^{2} - 4x + 1 + 6x - 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"194\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/e/b0e2b8d38da4e83465d00f29a1f723bd647974f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=4x^{2} + 2x - 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"121\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Second:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/f/16fb781ddf1f6fd31fb64caaecfd62117323087b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(g(x)) = f(x^{2} + 3x) = 2(x^{2} + 3x) - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"308\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/e/f8ede52fbd3bba8452f4f26c0541363a7996ef64.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=2x^{2} + 6x - 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"121\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/7/e67d761afb63e8f0edd165ef147dcaff9da0bbd5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g(f(x)) - f(g(x)) = 4x^{2} + 2x - 2 - (2x^{2} + 6x - 1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"402\" height=\"21\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/8/d182972ee9b2df0bf5959ff7be5a5607d7aa1f53.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(A) } 2x^{2} - 4x - 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"149\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Contest\">2025 TMTA Algebra II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_II_Contest_Problems\" title=\"2025 TMTA High School Algebra II Con